[SMUISceneTeamSelect]
NorthTeamInfoText="The JNA was the military of the Socialist Federal Republic of Yugoslavia from 1945-1992. As Yugoslavia began to break apart, the JNA started to intervene and give militarily support to ethnic Serb break-away republics in Croatia and Bosnia. They rely on conventional firepower and aerial support. They can deploy directly on their Squad Leader's position."
SouthTeamInfoText="The ZNG was established in 1991 in order to meet Croatia's demand for an armed force with military capabilities following its secession from Yugoslavia. Made up of former military, policemen, and draftees, they utilise imported or scavenged weaponry and rely on asymmetrical tactics. They can deploy on Squad Tunnels placed by their Squad Leaders."